BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 524 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 509 Td (Choose a private, unhurried moment, not the end of a busy meeting. Start with what you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 494 Td (have noticed, in neutral terms, for example, I have noticed you have seemed quieter) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 479 Td (lately. Then ask an open question, such as, how are things, really. Avoid questions) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 464 Td (that push for an answer, like, what is wrong with you. Make it clear that there is no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 449 Td (pressure to share. Some people will talk straight away, and others will not. Saying) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 434 Td (that the door is open, and following up later, is often what makes the next) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 419 Td (conversation easier.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 404 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.094 0.094 0.106 rg 56 383 Td (Listening without fixing) Tj ET
