BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 670 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 655 Td (Language matters. Helpful phrases include, that sounds really hard, thank you for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 640 Td (telling me, and, what would help right now. Phrases to avoid include, I know exactly) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 625 Td (how you feel, because you probably do not. Also avoid, just try to stay positive, and,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 610 Td (other people have it worse. These shut the conversation down. Keep your tone steady) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 595 Td (and unhurried. You do not have to say the perfect thing. A genuine, simple response,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 580 Td (such as, I am glad you told me, is usually enough to show you care.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 565 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.094 0.094 0.106 rg 56 544 Td (Knowing your limits) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 524 Td (- Do not promise confidentiality you cannot keep) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 509 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 494 Td (- Know when to involve others) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 479 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 464 Td (- Take immediate risk seriously) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 449 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 434 Td (Be honest about what you can promise. You should not promise absolute confidentiality,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 419 Td (because if there is a risk to someone's safety, you may need to involve others. Say) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 404 Td (what you can keep private and when you would need to share. Know your organisation's) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 389 Td (process and who to contact, such as HR or an employee assistance line. If someone is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 374 Td (in immediate danger or mentions harming themselves, treat it as urgent and follow your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 359 Td (emergency procedures. Knowing your limits is part of caring for the person well.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 344 Td () Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 0.094 0.094 0.106 rg 56 323 Td (Signposting and following up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 303 Td (- Know the support available) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 288 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 273 Td (- Offer, do not push) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 258 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 243 Td (- Check in again within a week) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 228 Td () Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 213 Td (Signposting means pointing someone to the right support. Learn what your organisation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 198 Td (offers, such as counselling, an employee assistance programme, or occupational health,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 183 Td (and also what external services exist. Offer the information and let the person) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 168 Td (choose. Then follow up. A short check in within a week, how are you doing, shows that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 153 Td (the first conversation was not a one-off. Keep a brief private note of what you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 138 Td (agreed. Following up is often the most valued part, because it shows that you meant) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 123 Td (what you said.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 0.25 0.25 0.27 rg 56 108 Td () Tj ET
